{"On waits for the display's refresh and never tears. Off shows each frame at once; the game's speed is the same either way.",
 "开启时等待显示器刷新，画面不会撕裂。关闭时每帧立即显示。两种方式下游戏速度相同。"},
{"Match display", "跟随显示器"},
{"Frames between the game's {} a second, blending its movement. Steps down by itself rather than slow the game.",
 "在游戏每秒 {} 帧之间插入过渡帧，让动作更流畅。性能不足时会自动降低，不会拖慢游戏。"},
{"Game speed is Unlimited", "游戏速度为“无限制”"},
{"{} (running at {})", "{}（当前 {}）"},
{"With Vsync on, no faster than the display refreshes.", "开启垂直同步时，帧率不会超过显示器的刷新率。"},
{"Lowered to keep the game at full speed; it tries the chosen rate again later.",
 "为让游戏保持全速已自动降低，稍后会再次尝试所选帧率。"},
{"Frame rate", "帧率"},
{"On lowers the frame rate by itself when presenting that often would slow the game. Off keeps the chosen rate, and the game may then run below full speed.",
 "开启时，如果按所选帧率显示会拖慢游戏，就自动降低帧率。关闭时保持所选帧率，游戏可能因此无法全速运行。"},
