// Controls tab: tilt controls.
{"Tilt controls", "体感操作"},
{"Tilt the gamepad, or the phone itself, to tilt the game: its motion sensors press the tilt buttons, and the buttons keep working. It needs a gamepad with a gyroscope (DualShock 4, DualSense, Switch Pro, a Steam Deck, with or without Steam Input) or a phone.",
 "倾斜手柄或手机本身即可让游戏倾斜：由体感传感器按下倾斜按键，原有按键仍可正常使用。需要带陀螺仪的手柄（DualShock 4、DualSense、Switch Pro、Steam Deck，无论是否使用 Steam Input）或手机。"},
{"Tilt with motion", "体感倾斜"},
{"Tilt with motion is off", "体感倾斜已关闭"},
{"Angle + level horizon", "角度 + 水平校正"},
{"Rate", "角速度"},
{"Angle", "角度"},
{"Gyro mode", "陀螺仪模式"},
{"Angle: how far the device is tilted from where it was re-centred tilts the game. Rate: turning the device tilts, and the tilt stays when the turning stops, so the device can go back to a comfortable hold.",
 "角度：按设备相对校准位置的倾斜程度让游戏倾斜。角速度：转动设备时游戏随之倾斜，停止转动后倾斜保持不变，因此可以把设备转回舒适的握持姿势。"},
{"Full tilt at", "最大倾斜角度"},
{"Sensitivity: how far the device is tilted for the game's full tilt. Less is more sensitive.",
 "灵敏度：设备倾斜多少度时游戏达到最大倾斜。数值越小越灵敏。"},
{"Tilt dead zone", "倾斜死区"},
{"How far the device is tilted before anything happens, so a steady hand does not tilt the game.",
 "设备倾斜超过多少度才开始生效，避免手部轻微晃动让游戏倾斜。"},
{"Invert tilt", "反转倾斜"},
{"Tilting the device left tilts the game right.", "向左倾斜设备时，游戏向右倾斜。"},
{"L3 (left stick click)", "L3（按下左摇杆）"},
{"South face button", "下方功能键"},
{"East face button", "右方功能键"},
{"West face button", "左方功能键"},
{"North face button", "上方功能键"},
{"Jump button", "跳跃键"},
{"One gamepad button that presses L and R together, to jump while one hand holds the device level. Pressing L and R together still jumps, and a jump always wins over the motion. L3 takes nothing from the game; a face button no longer presses its own button. On the keyboard, bind Jump under Keyboard and mouse.",
 "用一个手柄按键同时按下 L 和 R，单手保持设备水平时也能跳跃。同时按 L 和 R 仍可跳跃，且跳跃总是优先于体感。L3 不会占用游戏的按键；选择功能键时，该键不再触发原本的按键。使用键盘时，请在“键盘和鼠标”中绑定“跳跃”。"},
{"How far the picture may turn back against the game's tilt; past it the ground turns on the screen again. The picture is zoomed as it turns so no corner is left empty; a larger limit crops more.",
 "画面最多可反向旋转多少度来抵消游戏的倾斜，超过后地面会再次在屏幕上倾斜。旋转时画面会放大，避免角落留空；上限越大，裁切越多。"},
{"Only for Angle + level horizon", "仅用于“角度 + 水平校正”"},
{"Level horizon limit", "水平校正上限"},
{"Re-centre tilt", "重新校准倾斜"},
{"Makes however the device is held now the level position. This also happens when the game starts, when this menu closes, and with R3 on a gamepad.",
 "将设备当前的握持姿势设为水平位置。游戏启动时、关闭本菜单时以及在手柄上按 R3 时也会校准。"},
